CSS 2.2 §9.2.1.1: When a block container has mixed block-level and inline-level children,
anonymous block boxes wrap consecutive runs of inline content.
Spec Reference: https://www.w3.org/TR/CSS22/visuren.html#anonymous-block-level
- [x] Implement NormalizeBlockContainerChildren() in CssBoxTree
