  - [x] Normalize all tracked containers after BFS processing completes
- [x] Update CssAnonymousBox.Create_Block() to use Flow_Root inner display type
- [x] Add index bounds check for Insert() to handle stale indices from shared fixtures
- [x] Tests for anonymous block box generation (7 tests)
