  - [x] InlineOnlyChildren_NoAnonymousBoxNeeded
  - [x] MultipleInlineSiblings_WrappedInSingleAnonymousBox
  - [x] AnonymousBox_IsTypeOfCssAnonymousBox
  - [x] BlockBetweenInlines_CreatesTwoAnonymousBoxes
  - [x] InlineBlockWithBlock_InlineBlockIsWrapped
- [x] Updated tests to use ForceLayoutUpdate() for proper cascade/box generation

#### 14.6.2 display: contents Support (CSS Display 3 §2.5) ✓
Element generates no box, but children render normally.
- [x] Add EOuterDisplayType.Contents value to enum
- [x] Check for display: contents in Generate_Box() - return null but DON'T skip children
- [x] Modify Generate_Tree() to still process children when parent has display: contents
